/t_thumb/scx77j.jpg"}, {"id": 1548992, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scx77k.jpg"}, {"id": 1548993, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scx77l.jpg"}, {"id": 1548994, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scx77m.jpg"}], "slug": "frequency-of-fear", "storyline": "You will play as Maya, a newcomer urban explorer on an adventure to uncover hidden truths and starts her journey to become a famous streamer. What begins as material for her expanding channel gradually devolves into a terrifying journey into the unknown. The deeper she explores the eerie alleyways, and creepy houses, the more reality begins to unravel around her. Capture it with Maya and experience the horror that lies beneath Halimun!", "summary": "\"FREQUENCY OF FEAR\" is a third-person, episodic psychological horror game that drags you into the disctrict of Halimun, a village that used to be known for it's mysticism, folklore, and secrets. Are you brave enough to find out? Discover what's still there in Halimun District!\n\nPlay as Maya, an aspiring urban explorer. Break taboos, film forbidden places, and explore the district of Halimun. Solve puzzles, uncover secrets, but be careful. Some curses don\u2019t wait to be believed. Stay hidden, and don\u2019t get caught!", "themes": [{"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/frequency-of-fear", "videos": [{"id": 125433, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "flMDCaTLdu8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=flMDCaTLdu8", "title": "Ghost Frequency | Ghost of The SEA 2024 Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/flMDCaTLdu8/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 144456, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "9f8qcdlpYJs", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9f8qcdlpYJs", "title": "FoF  Teaser (old)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9f8qcdlpYJs/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 155118, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "gePGrcso1fM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gePGrcso1fM", "title": "Frequency of Fear